FerrionOS change to base (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 20f7573b4dc011ea5267189185edc0b2f12bab0f with ferrion-boot-splash.patch, ferrion-lockdown.patch, ferrion-pty-hangup.patch, ferrion-live-disk-view.patch, ferrion-sigchld.patch, ferrion-signal-handle-perm.patch, ferrion-rand-seed.patch, ferrion-driver-null-namespace.patch and ferrion-scheme-create-fork.patch applied. The namespace manager checks the lengths in a request against the request:
- a fork request whose name length runs past the end of the request, or overflows, is answered with EINVAL.
- the payload after a dup request's kind is taken with a checked range as well.

